Subject: [PATCH] Defer animation action translation until UI construction

Store untranslated KLocalizedString descriptors during static initialization.
Resolve them at the existing timeline UI call sites, after the application
and its selected language exist. This also preserves the selected language
in static builds instead of caching a pre-application translation.

diff --git a/plugins/dockers/animation/KisAnimUtils.cpp b/plugins/dockers/animation/KisAnimUtils.cpp
